WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.370
Schedule Mix- Up.

2
00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:02.589
You misread the schedule and

3
00:00:02.589 --> 00:00:06.478
discover you were expected earlier. What do you do? A...

4
00:00:06.478 --> 00:00:10.043
Say the schedule was confusing and leave it there. B...

5
